{"In GoogleCalendarService.refreshAvailabilityCache, SelectedCalendarRepository.updateManyByCredentialId passes an empty update object which will cause a Prisma error. Should explicitly update a field like updatedAt or remove the call.": 0.9206969738006592, "The test-gcal-webhooks.sh script uses sed -i '' which is macOS-specific. Should use a cross-platform approach if the script is intended for broader use.": 0.6160842180252075, "Using a generic Error in deleteCache.handler.ts loses granularity and doesn't map cleanly to tRPC error codes. Should use TRPCError with a specific code like NOT_FOUND instead.": 0.586085855960846, "The action container div renders even when CredentialActionsDropdown returns null, leaving empty layout space. The container should only render when there are actions to display.": 0.7415391206741333}